hinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하기로","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단단하게","meaning":"坚定","explanation":"단단하다：坚定；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"단단하다","audio":"/audio/a95f2893084560fb1a3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28370","senseId":"3","lemma":"단단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음을","meaning":"心思，心意，意向","explanation":"마음：心思，心意，意向；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"5","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었거든.","meaning":"下定决心（마음을 먹다）","explanation":"먹다：下定决心（마음을 먹다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"5","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"5998c9b179df5fd3","term":"다이어트","zh":"节食，减肥","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3","entryId":"28352","definition":"为了健康或美容而调节饮食种类和量。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a95f2893084560fb","term":"단단하다","zh":"坚定","audio":"/audio/a95f2893084560fb1a3a.mp3","entryId":"28370","definition":"用意或想法强硬而不动摇。","pronunciation":["단단하다"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心思，心意，意向","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"要做某事的想法或意愿。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"下定决心